# Architecture — Layers & Config

Mirror folder structure to layers: `theme/`, `component/`, `display/`, `layout/`, `registry/`, `headless/`, `view/`, `engine/`, `types/`, `utils/`, `constants/`.

## Import boundaries

- `headless/` → never `view/` or `engine/`
- `view/layout/` → sealed; not exported; plugins use plugin interface only
- `engine/` → only layer that integrates all others
- Cross-layer imports via each layer’s `index.ts` — no deep cross-layer paths

## Config files (consumer-facing)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `theme-config` | Tailwind tokens; deep-merge partials; frozen after init |
| `component-config` | `overrideComponent` **xor** `extendVariant`; scoped `style` |
| `display-config` | boolean flags only; unknown keys warn at init |
| `layout-config` | 12 zones + `order` ascending; empty zones collapse |

## Headless & tracking

- Hooks: `useReducer` + `useSyncExternalStore`; self-register on mount, cleanup on unmount
- Global Tracking Register: engine-owned singleton — not exported
- `useTableEngine`: consumer-only, outside HOC/headless hooks

## Performance (required)

Row + column virtualization (TanStack Virtual), `React.memo`, stable refs, batched updates, fine-grained subscriptions.

